.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.TH OCTA-STATE 1 "" "OCTA-CAPTURE @PROJECT_VERSION@" "OCTA-CAPTURE Manual"
.SH NAME
octa\-state \- read the complete CTRL device state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBocta-state\fR [CTRL-PORT]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read and validate the complete 1146-byte device bulk state.
Print decoded parameters and raw payload as JSON; do not change parameter values.
This does not measure analog signal response or establish streaming.
.PP
The default CTRL MIDI port is hw:CARD=OCTACAPTURE,DEV=0,SUBDEV=1. Close other control-panel/CTRL clients before opening it. Audio streaming is independent of this connection.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success; nonzero indicates a usage, device or operation error.
.SH SEE ALSO
octa-capture(1), octa-status(1), octa-preset(1)
